    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a new adventure of Blop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a peaceful walk through the forest, blop find a monolith. After touching he was teleported in the dungeon. His goal is to find the way out, yours \u2014 is to help him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Monolith:</strong><br>Find pieces of the monolith to restore its structure. The monolith reacts to the player\u2019s actions and teleport the slime to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Brewing:</strong><br>Combine ingredients and experiment with different recipes to craft potions for solving puzzles and interacting with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Restart:</strong> <br>If something goes wrong, use the restart potion to reset the current level and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a new adventure of Blop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a peaceful walk through the forest, blop find a monolith. After touching he was teleported in the dungeon. His goal is to find the way out, yours \u2014 is to help him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Monolith:</strong><br>Find pieces of the monolith to restore its structure. The monolith reacts to the player\u2019s actions and teleport the slime to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/9380ee0d001bd3beb3165433784354c4.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Brewing:</strong><br>Combine ingredients and experiment with different recipes to craft potions for solving puzzles and interacting with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/b14d65264a4650dd19e1359de5e357d8.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Restart:</strong> <br>If something goes wrong, use the restart potion to reset the current level and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.poster.avif?t=1749058629\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.webm?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/02df39e627ff2a5d6e7e02d31518cc04.mp4?t=1749058629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
